; disequality map by a later one between the same classes (the check treated a still
; valid entry as outdated). After backtracking past the later one, the E-graph merged
; the two classes although the equality literal was still false; Z3 then kept citing
; that equality, the propagator kept returning the same already-satisfied clause, and
; the solver never terminated (ignoring --timeout). Random fuzz case (seed 536), ddsmt-reduced.
